      "body": "Right, nothing on the passing side reached NONE, SINGLE or ANYONECANPAY. I added a second transaction to `scriptPathSpending` with one input per remaining hash type, derived the same way as the rest of the file.\n\nI changed `SignatureHashSchnorr` three ways, to ignore ANYONECANPAY, to commit NONE to the outputs and to take output 0 for SINGLE. Each time the old file still passed and the new one failed.\n",
